{"turn_id": "d01-t1", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 1, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_data_used", "text": "The authors compared Google Translate's pronominal gender translation statistics against U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics data on the frequency of women's participation in each job position.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation", "text": "The authors compared the distribution of female workers with the frequency of female translations and found no correlation between these variables.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "gt_fails_real_distribution", "text": "The authors state that Google Translate outputs fail to reflect the real-world distribution of female workers, underestimating the expected frequency.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "inverse_histogram", "text": "They report that the distribution of translated female pronouns is inversely distributed, with female pronouns accumulating in the first 12-quantile, whereas BLS data shows female participation peaks in the fourth 12-quantile.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "demographic_source", "text": "The comparison used U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics data on the percentage of women's participation in each occupation category, taken as the real-world demographic reference.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "hypothesis_tested", "text": "The authors explicitly tested the hypothesis that Google Translate's male defaults might merely reflect the unequal distribution of male and female workers in some job positions.", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t1", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": false, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
{"turn_id": "d01-t2", "session_id": "d01", "turn": 2, "answer": {"claims": [{"key": "bls_comparison_conducted", "text": "作者将其性别代词翻译统计与按职业划分的美国劳工统计局（BLS）女性参与比例数据进行了对比，以检验Google Translate的男性默认倾向是否只是反映了某些职位中男女从业者分布不均。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "quantile_distribution_method", "text": "BLS数据按单个职业提供，作者据此计算了每个12分位数对应的女性参与频率，并对译出的女性代词频率做了同样的计算，并将两组直方图并列绘制。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "male_dominated_definition", "text": "论文将女性参与率低于25%的领域视为男性主导领域，这一阈值引用了美国劳工部妇女局的说法。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "no_correlation_finding", "text": "作者比较了女性从业者的分布与女性译法出现的频率，发现这两个变量之间没有相关性。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "inverse_pronoun_distribution", "text": "译出女性代词分布与真实分布方向相反，女性代词集中出现在第一个12分位数；而BLS数据显示女性参与率在第四个12分位数达到峰值，并在之后几个分位数仍保持显著。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}]}, {"key": "fails_to_reflect_real_distribution", "text": "数据表明Google Translate的输出未能反映覆盖大量职位的女性工作者真实分布，并且低估了女性代词出现的预期频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-6d84e20bfa1a0d5f93e73fb6"}, {"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "male_defaults_exceed_demographics", "text": "作者指出，即使不预期翻译性别代词呈50:50分布，Google Translate出现男性默认的频率也高于仅凭职业人口数据所能推得的程度，这种男性默认的突出程度在作者看来尚缺乏明确依据。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-1c78b22c818d4036c6510107"}]}, {"key": "study_design", "text": "研究以BLS的详细职业表构建12种性别中立语言的“He/She is an Engineer”类句式，用Google Translate API译为英语，并统计译文中女性、男性和性别中立代词的出现频率。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-0ff7525d7bb39cc1411d378f"}]}, {"key": "experiment_date", "text": "论文中报告的所有实验均在2018年4月进行。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-c49993752c0b10ccfb6bdc75"}]}, {"key": "operational_bias_definition", "text": "作者对“负面性别偏见”的判定假设是：若男性默认的频率高估了某职业中男性雇员与女性雇员的（可能不平等的）分布，则Google Translate存在负面性别偏见。", "citations": [{"paper_id": "1809.02208", "chunk_id": "c-bf50e77dea8722dc9d0a44b4"}]}], "decision": "answer"}, "error": null, "trace_id": "d01-t2", "assessment": {"execution_success": true, "task_success": null, "pipeline_success": null, "behavior_match": true, "schema_valid": true, "stage_flow_valid": true, "citation_structure_valid": true, "memory_committed": true, "nlu_correct": true, "reflect_correct": null, "retrieval_effective": true, "generate_valid": true, "degraded": false}}
